OrbitInk - BookOrbit firmware for Xteink X3

OrbitInk continues CrossFade and its CrossPoint ancestry. This source tree also merges
CrossInk v1.6.1 (9914146eeae7b46b300f475a16c32426fc02ec1f) through merge
a9898b6c85acfa7e5dbda9ebe255d3f23571afeb. CrossInk is licensed under MIT;
retain the upstream copyright notices in individual source files.
OrbitInk's original changes use the root MIT terms. Linked dependencies retain their
own licenses: in particular, the root MIT license does not override wolfSSL's
COPYING/LICENSING terms. OrbitInk distributes the combined linked firmware under
GNU GPL version 3, exercising wolfSSL's "GPLv2 or any later version" option to
accommodate the linked Apache-2.0 components. See LICENSES/COPYING.GPL3.
Individual source files retain their original MIT, Apache, LGPL, font and other
notices; this does not relabel all source files as GPL-only. Binary releases
include matching corresponding source and actual component notices.
Optional SD Chinese fonts are not distributed.

